{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-ops","title":"监控与运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/message-queues-event-driven/systems/observability-ops","wordCount":1565,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"监控与运维\">监控与运维</h1><p>异步系统最危险的地方在于：它出问题时往往悄无声息。同步调用失败会立刻把错误抛回调用方，用户和监控当场感知；而消息消费变慢、积压、卡死，前端可能毫无异样，直到积压撑爆磁盘、或用户开始抱怨「下了单半小时还没发货」。这一篇讲上线之后该盯什么、怎么把无形的异步链路变得可见、以及常见故障的排查路径。它把前面所有篇章的隐患——<a href=\"../event-driven/event-driven-architecture\">最终一致性</a>、<a href=\"../patterns/dead-letter-retry\">死信堆积</a>、<a href=\"ordering-idempotency\">消费滞后</a>——收束到可运维的层面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>消息系统的可观测性围绕三类信号：<strong>滞后类</strong>（消费跟不跟得上生产）、<strong>失败类</strong>（处理失败和死信情况）、<strong>容量类</strong>（broker 和队列的资源水位）。它们共同回答一个问题：这套异步管道现在健康吗？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PROD[生产速率] --&gt; LAG{消费滞后&lt;br/&gt;= 最新offset - 已提交offset}&#10;    CONS[消费速率] --&gt; LAG&#10;    LAG --&gt;|持续增长| ALERT[告警: 消费跟不上]&#10;    DLQ[(死信队列深度)] --&gt;|突增| ALERT2[告警: 处理在失败]&#10;    DISK[broker 磁盘/内存] --&gt;|逼近上限| ALERT3[告警: 容量风险]&#10;    ALERT --&gt; ACT[扩容/排查/限流]&#10;    ALERT2 --&gt; ACT&#10;    ALERT3 --&gt; ACT\">flowchart TD\n    PROD[生产速率] --&gt; LAG{消费滞后&lt;br/&gt;= 最新offset - 已提交offset}\n    CONS[消费速率] --&gt; LAG\n    LAG --&gt;|持续增长| ALERT[告警: 消费跟不上]\n    DLQ[(死信队列深度)] --&gt;|突增| ALERT2[告警: 处理在失败]\n    DISK[broker 磁盘/内存] --&gt;|逼近上限| ALERT3[告警: 容量风险]\n    ALERT --&gt; ACT[扩容/排查/限流]\n    ALERT2 --&gt; ACT\n    ALERT3 --&gt; ACT</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>健康信号</th>\n<th>异常信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消费滞后 (lag)</td>\n<td>待消费消息积压量</td>\n<td>平稳、接近 0</td>\n<td>持续单调增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端延迟</td>\n<td>生产到处理完耗时</td>\n<td>在 SLA 内</td>\n<td>长尾变长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死信队列深度</td>\n<td>处理失败累积</td>\n<td>接近 0</td>\n<td>非零且增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费/生产速率比</td>\n<td>处理能力是否够</td>\n<td>≈ 1 或更高</td>\n<td>&lt; 1（消费跟不上）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>broker 资源</td>\n<td>磁盘/内存/连接数</td>\n<td>有余量</td>\n<td>逼近上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"消费滞后-最重要的单一指标\">消费滞后：最重要的单一指标</h2><p>如果只能盯一个指标，盯<strong>消费滞后（consumer lag）</strong>。它的定义直白：分区当前最新消息的 offset 减去消费组已提交的 offset，等于还有多少消息没被消费。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>lag</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>offset</mtext><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>offset</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{lag} = \\text{offset}_{latest} - \\text{offset}_{committed}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lag</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>lag 的趋势比绝对值更有意义。一个稳定在小数值附近波动的 lag 是健康的；而一个<strong>持续单调增长</strong>的 lag 意味着消费速率长期低于生产速率，积压只会越滚越大，最终撑爆保留空间或让端到端延迟无限拉长。</p>\n<p>设生产速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、消费速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu &lt; \\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 时积压以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\lambda - \\mu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的速度增长——这和<a href=\"../foundations/messaging-overview\">消息传递与解耦</a>里削峰填谷的排队模型是同一个式子，只不过这次它从「设计意图」变成了「告警依据」。短期 lag 上升是削峰的正常表现（峰值被吸收）；长期 lag 上升则是容量不足的红灯。应对手段：增加消费组实例（但不能超过分区数，多出的实例会空闲）、优化单条处理耗时、或必要时给生产端限流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"端到端追踪-把因果链串起来\">端到端追踪：把因果链串起来</h2><p><a href=\"../event-driven/event-driven-architecture\">事件驱动架构</a>把一次业务操作打散成跨多个服务的事件链，单看任何一个服务的日志都只是碎片。要排查「这笔订单为什么没发货」，必须把整条链串起来——这靠的是<strong>关联 ID（correlation ID）<strong>和</strong>分布式追踪</strong>。</p>\n<p>做法是：在业务入口生成一个唯一的 trace ID，随消息一路透传（放在消息头里），每个消费者处理时都把这个 ID 打进日志和追踪 span。这样在 OpenTelemetry、Jaeger 这类工具里，就能看到一条消息从生产、经过 broker、被各个消费者处理的完整时间线，包括它在哪一环停滞、在哪一环失败。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    REQ[下单请求&lt;br/&gt;生成 traceId=abc] --&gt; MQ1[OrderPlaced&lt;br/&gt;带 traceId]&#10;    MQ1 --&gt; S1[库存服务 span]&#10;    MQ1 --&gt; S2[通知服务 span]&#10;    S1 --&gt; MQ2[InventoryReserved&lt;br/&gt;透传 traceId]&#10;    MQ2 --&gt; S3[仓库服务 span]&#10;    S3 --&gt; TR[追踪系统聚合&lt;br/&gt;按 traceId 还原全链路]\">flowchart TD\n    REQ[下单请求&lt;br/&gt;生成 traceId=abc] --&gt; MQ1[OrderPlaced&lt;br/&gt;带 traceId]\n    MQ1 --&gt; S1[库存服务 span]\n    MQ1 --&gt; S2[通知服务 span]\n    S1 --&gt; MQ2[InventoryReserved&lt;br/&gt;透传 traceId]\n    MQ2 --&gt; S3[仓库服务 span]\n    S3 --&gt; TR[追踪系统聚合&lt;br/&gt;按 traceId 还原全链路]</pre><p>没有关联 ID 的异步系统，排查问题基本靠猜。这是<a href=\"../foundations/messaging-overview\">消息传递与解耦</a>中提到的「可观测性复杂度」代价的具体偿付方式——你享受了解耦，就必须主动建设追踪来补回可见性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"死信与告警策略\">死信与告警策略</h2><p><a href=\"../patterns/dead-letter-retry\">死信与重试</a>那一篇强调过：死信队列绝不能设了不管。从运维角度，DLQ 深度是一个极其灵敏的早期故障信号——它往往比错误日志的告警更早、更准地暴露问题，因为一条消息进 DLQ 意味着它已经重试到上限仍失败，是「确实出事了」的确定信号。</p>\n<p>告警策略上有几个实践原则。<strong>对趋势告警，而非瞬时值</strong>：lag 偶尔尖一下是正常的，对「lag 持续 N 分钟增长」告警才有意义。<strong>分级告警</strong>：DLQ 出现 1 条 → 通知，DLQ 快速增长 → 升级呼叫值班。<strong>告警要可执行</strong>：每条告警都应对应明确的处置动作（扩容、重放、限流），否则就是噪声。把这些指标接入 Prometheus + Grafana（或云厂商的监控）做仪表盘和告警规则，是 2026 年消息系统运维的标准配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量规划与常见故障\">容量规划与常见故障</h2><p>运维不只是被动救火，还包括前瞻的容量规划。几个关键决策：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分区数</strong>：决定了消费并行度上限（消费者实例数不能超过分区数），且后期<a href=\"../foundations/queues-topics\">难以无损调整</a>（改分区数会破坏既有键到分区的映射，打乱顺序），所以要按未来吞吐前瞻规划。</li>\n<li><strong>保留策略</strong>：保留太短，新消费者或重放够不到历史；保留太长，磁盘成本飙升。按重放需求和合规要求权衡。</li>\n<li><strong>副本数</strong>：决定 broker 端的容错与持久性，是<a href=\"../foundations/delivery-guarantees\">投递保证</a>中 broker 这一环不丢的基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>常见故障的排查路径：lag 持续涨 → 看消费者是慢、是挂、还是数量不足；DLQ 涨 → 看是某类消息普遍失败（代码 bug / 下游故障）还是个别毒丸；端到端延迟长尾 → 看是某个分区热点（回到<a href=\"ordering-idempotency\">顺序与幂等</a>的分区键设计）还是某个消费者实例异常；broker 磁盘满 → 看保留策略和积压。把这些路径预先写成 runbook，故障时才不会手忙脚乱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>异步系统故障常无声，必须主动监控；信号分滞后类、失败类、容量类三组。</li>\n<li>消费滞后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>lag</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>offset</mtext><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>offset</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{lag} = \\text{offset}_{latest} - \\text{offset}_{committed}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lag</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是最重要指标，看趋势而非绝对值，持续增长即红灯。</li>\n<li>用关联 ID + 分布式追踪把打散的事件链串起来，偿付解耦带来的可观测性代价。</li>\n<li>DLQ 深度是灵敏的早期故障信号；告警应对趋势、分级、且可执行。</li>\n<li>容量规划聚焦分区数、保留策略、副本数；预写 runbook 覆盖 lag/DLQ/延迟/磁盘的排查路径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监控与运维","id":"监控与运维"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"消费滞后：最重要的单一指标","id":"消费滞后-最重要的单一指标"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端追踪：把因果链串起来","id":"端到端追踪-把因果链串起来"},{"level":2,"text":"死信与告警策略","id":"死信与告警策略"},{"level":2,"text":"容量规划与常见故障","id":"容量规划与常见故障"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"顺序与幂等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/message-queues-event-driven/systems/ordering-idempotency"},"next":null}